{"exhaustive":{"nbHits":false,"typo":false},"exhaustiveNbHits":false,"exhaustiveTypo":false,"hits":[{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"AlexErrant"},"comment_text":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["incident","agent"],"value":"If doing the right thing were easy, it wouldn't be what gives you character.<p>I agree: having charges brought against you is a life-changing event. FWIW neither Chan Tsz-yan nor Josh Renaud were arrested, and in both cases the charges were dropped. <a href=\"https://pressfreedomtracker.us/all-incidents/missouri-governor-labels-reporter-a-hacker-threatens-criminal-prosecution/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pressfreedomtracker.us/all-<em>incidents</em>/missouri-govern...</a> <a href=\"https://missouriindependent.com/2022/02/11/prosecutor-isnt-pressing-charges-against-reporter-who-found-flaw-in-state-website/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://missouriindependent.com/2022/02/11/prosecutor-isnt-p...</a><p>The system sucks, and will always suck.<p>If you think these two cases out of umpteen billion CVE/security <em>incident</em> reports are odds enough to hide your face and turn away because the risk is too much... I apologize for being crass, but frankly you're being a little bitch.<p>If these odds <em>aren't</em> good enough for you to live up to your values, what are?"},"story_title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Frontier Airlines Likely Breached"},"story_url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://www.reddit.com/r/frontierairlines/comments/1xl20e8/psa_email_scam/"}},"_tags":["comment","author_AlexErrant","story_50327266"],"author":"AlexErrant","comment_text":"If doing the right thing were easy, it wouldn&#x27;t be what gives you character.<p>I agree: having charges brought against you is a life-changing event. FWIW neither Chan Tsz-yan nor Josh Renaud were arrested, and in both cases the charges were dropped. <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;pressfreedomtracker.us&#x2F;all-incidents&#x2F;missouri-governor-labels-reporter-a-hacker-threatens-criminal-prosecution&#x2F;\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;pressfreedomtracker.us&#x2F;all-incidents&#x2F;missouri-govern...</a> <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;missouriindependent.com&#x2F;2022&#x2F;02&#x2F;11&#x2F;prosecutor-isnt-pressing-charges-against-reporter-who-found-flaw-in-state-website&#x2F;\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;missouriindependent.com&#x2F;2022&#x2F;02&#x2F;11&#x2F;prosecutor-isnt-p...</a><p>The system sucks, and will always suck.<p>If you think these two cases out of umpteen billion CVE&#x2F;security incident reports are odds enough to hide your face and turn away because the risk is too much... I apologize for being crass, but frankly you&#x27;re being a little bitch.<p>If these odds aren&#x27;t good enough for you to live up to your values, what are?","created_at":"2026-11-02T04:09:34Z","created_at_i":1793592574,"objectID":"50333025","parent_id":50332419,"story_id":50327266,"story_title":"Frontier Airlines Likely Breached","story_url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/frontierairlines/comments/1xl20e8/psa_email_scam/","updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:56:26Z"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"hunterpayne"},"comment_text":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["incident","agent"],"value":"The only real (ie large) nuclear accident happened under communism.  And the reason why we don't have even safer nuclear designs is because of regulation.  This entire discussion is entirely backwards and isn't looking at the data.  Look where and why <em>incidents</em> happened.  When you do, you will find various causes, none of which are fixed by political ideology.  They are fixed by engineering and insurance costs.<p>Chernobyl happened because the son of a central committee member needed data from a dangerous experiment that was conducted at the powerplant.  They literally disabled safety systems with wrenches.  Both the design itself would have never allowed in the west nor would the experiment that caused the accident.  Also, the HBO movie was very inaccurate so please don't bring up something you saw there, many of the things in the movie <em>aren't</em> even scientifically possible."},"story_title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"UK Green party drops longstanding opposition to nuclear power"},"story_url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/oct/05/green-party-nuclear-power-policy"}},"_tags":["comment","author_hunterpayne","story_50318189"],"author":"hunterpayne","comment_text":"The only real (ie large) nuclear accident happened under communism.  And the reason why we don&#x27;t have even safer nuclear designs is because of regulation.  This entire discussion is entirely backwards and isn&#x27;t looking at the data.  Look where and why incidents happened.  When you do, you will find various causes, none of which are fixed by political ideology.  They are fixed by engineering and insurance costs.<p>Chernobyl happened because the son of a central committee member needed data from a dangerous experiment that was conducted at the powerplant.  They literally disabled safety systems with wrenches.  Both the design itself would have never allowed in the west nor would the experiment that caused the accident.  Also, the HBO movie was very inaccurate so please don&#x27;t bring up something you saw there, many of the things in the movie aren&#x27;t even scientifically possible.","created_at":"2026-11-01T19:27:38Z","created_at_i":1793561258,"objectID":"50328816","parent_id":50325092,"story_id":50318189,"story_title":"UK Green party drops longstanding opposition to nuclear power","story_url":"https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/oct/05/green-party-nuclear-power-policy","updated_at":"2026-11-01T22:14:41Z"}],"hitsPerPage":2,"nbHits":135,"nbPages":68,"page":0,"params":"query=incident+agent&tags=%28story%2Ccom